      "writtenOn": "2016-07-30T20:40:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the code was meant to calculate the 1250ppm cutoff for the sof trim buckets.  The problem is, the targetCnt*(1000000-1250) overflowed the 32b values and caused the buckets to be completely wrong.  \n\nI\u0027m sure there is a much smarter way to deal with this, but I just did the easy thing and made it a 64b int.",
